# Time and notification preferences

Show times in the app's local timezone. Store instants in UTC. A date-only value must not move to another calendar day because of timezone conversion.

Goals and to-dos start with a default notification frequency. The user can change it at any time. Store the setting in the database so a device change does not drop it.
